wacomtablet (3.2.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Restore running the unit tests at build time, as autopkgtest is not a
    replacement for this.
  * Add the libxcb-xfixes0-dev build dependency, as apparently libxcb-xinput-dev
    does not pull it automatically (while using its headers).
  * Drop the 'testsuite' autopkgtest, as it does not test the installed
    packages.
  * Remove gbp.conf, as the packaging repository does not use git buildpackage.
  * Do not explicitly specify --buildsystem=cmake to dh, as cmake is the only
    build system available.
  * Stop passing --fail-missing to dh_missing, as everything is already
    installed in the only binary package (kde-config-tablet) of this source.
  * Improve salsa CI configuration to run more standard checks.
  * Stop using the non-existing ${shlibs:Recommends} substvar.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.4.1, no changes required.

 -- Pino Toscano <pino@debian.org>  Tue, 31 Dec 2019 16:41:57 +0100

